Z||000021||Bazooka||05-29-2001||10:31 PM||||Hey IOCG,<BR>   I gotta ask you about your 3.4 with the twin cam. I have a quad 4 engine in another car and it hauls at 3000 rpm and above. Where would you say that your power curve and torque come in on your engine? That is pretty much a direct bolt in except for the starter location, right? Is it 210 HP?<BR>[QUOTE]Originally posted by lowCG:<BR>[B]I've got the 3.4TDC in my car<P>||||reg||1
